    rdfs:comment "Artifact-derived aggregates: train (with_surface): 3420; test (with_surface): 377. Species: {Al, Ti}; atoms/config 1-168. energies/forces in the companion train/test_energies+forces JSON files The deposit also carries a without_surface variant of the train/test JSONs." .
